# House rules

Everything an agent needs to know that is true of **this repository only**.
The skills in `.claude/skills/` carry the general discipline and name nothing
specific; this file is where the specifics live. Keep it short and keep it true
— a stale fact here is worse than a missing one, because it will be believed.

Delete any heading that does not apply.

