## Known deviations

Places that do not follow the rules, why, and whether they should be fixed.
Recording them stops the next person "fixing" something deliberate, and stops a
drift check reporting the same false positive forever.

## Who to ask

For decisions an agent should not make alone: schema changes, anything
user-facing, anything irreversible, anything touching money or identity.
